    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/2a67ba58752d1aa3c02da634a7edbc4d.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=670 height=143 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/2a67ba58752d1aa3c02da634a7edbc4d.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape from your own home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The doors and windows are boarded up. You must find a way out while discovering, along the way, who has locked you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is someone else here</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will have to hide and escape from the sinister inhabitants, which you will find in the different areas you visit during your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your intellect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Solve strange puzzles that have appeared in your house to escape your confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out who has locked you up and created these puzzles.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/2a67ba58752d1aa3c02da634a7edbc4d.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=670 height=143 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/2a67ba58752d1aa3c02da634a7edbc4d.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape from your own home</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cab4f3eb8388f0581b7164513405d4f.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The doors and windows are boarded up. You must find a way out while discovering, along the way, who has locked you in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is someone else here</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/7cf37a50190153bfea3773ac37fda3fe.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>You will have to hide and escape from the sinister inhabitants, which you will find in the different areas you visit during your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test your intellect</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.poster.avif?t=1755088363\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.webm?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645200/extras/9c0d26ff4f645b7fa2223b437c42e28c.mp4?t=1755088363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Solve strange puzzles that have appeared in your house to escape your confinement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find out who has locked you up and created these puzzles.</p>",
    "short_description": "Escape from your own house, in which you have been locked up. But be careful, you will not be alone in your captivity. Immerse yourself in this first-person horror adventure, full of family secrets and betrayals. And find out who and why they locked you up.",
